---
import LegalLayout from '../components/legal/LegalLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../components/legal/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { LICENCE_TERMS } from '../data/catalog';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const lastUpdated = new Date('2026-10-11');

const toc = [
  { id: 'summary', label: 'Summary' },
  { id: 'websites-custom', label: 'Websites and custom builds' },
  { id: 'discovery', label: 'Discovery Sprint and Rescue Audit' },
  { id: 'systems', label: 'Ready-made systems' },
  { id: 'care', label: 'Care Plans' },
  { id: 'third-party', label: 'Third-party costs and hardware' },
  { id: 'how', label: 'How to ask for a refund' }
];
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="When WSS DevLabs refunds deposits, licence fees and Care Plans, and how to ask for a refund."
  path="/refunds/"
  lastUpdated={lastUpdated}
  intro="Clear rules on cancellations and refunds, so nobody is surprised. Your rights under Malaysian consumer law are not affected."
  toc={toc}
>
  <h2 id="summary">Summary</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Cancel a website or custom build before you approve the design: we refund your deposit, minus the work already done.</li>
    <li>A ready-made system that can't be installed by following the guide, and that we can't fix: full refund within {LICENCE_TERMS.refundDays} days.</li>
    <li>Monthly Care Plans: cancel any time, effective at the end of the paid month.</li>
  </ul>
  <LegalIdentity />

  <h2 id="websites-custom">Websites and custom builds</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Before design approval:</strong> if you cancel, we refund your deposit minus the work already done, which we show you in
      writing.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>After design approval:</strong> payments for milestones already reached aren't refundable. We invoice work done up to
      the cancellation, and hand over that work once it's paid for.
    </li>
    <li>If we can't deliver what we agreed and don't fix it within a reasonable time, you may cancel and receive a refund for the undelivered work.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="discovery">Discovery Sprint and Rescue Audit</h2>
  <p>
    Refunded in full if you cancel before the first workshop or before we start the audit. After that they aren't refundable, but
    you keep everything delivered, including the documents and report.
  </p>

  <h2 id="systems">Ready-made systems</h2>
  <p>
    If the system can't be installed by following the install guide and we can't fix the problem, we refund the licence fee in full,
    as long as you tell us within {LICENCE_TERMS.refundDays} days of delivery. Because software can be copied once downloaded, there
    is no refund if you simply change your mind after download. Watch it working on a screen-share before you buy if you're unsure.
  </p>

  <h2 id="care">Care Plans</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Monthly plans:</strong> cancel any time. The plan ends at the end of the month you've paid for.</li>
    <li><strong>Yearly plans:</strong> if you cancel within 30 days of paying, we refund the unused months. After that, the plan runs until the end of the paid year.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="third-party">Third-party costs and hardware</h2>
  <p>
    Domain registrations, payment gateway fees, WhatsApp (Meta) fees and other third-party costs paid on your behalf can't be refunded
    by us once paid. Hardware follows the supplier's returns and warranty terms.
  </p>

  <h2 id="how">How to ask for a refund</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or WhatsApp {SITE.phone} with your invoice number and the reason. We reply
    within one business day. Approved refunds are paid to the account you paid from within 14 days.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
